{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211750/extras/b18a84fa0b10129b36b19d5cd031e5db.poster.avif?t=1770205975\" width=650 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211750/extras/b18a84fa0b10129b36b19d5cd031e5db.webm?t=1770205975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211750/extras/b18a84fa0b10129b36b19d5cd031e5db.mp4?t=1770205975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neongarten is a captivating turn-based strategy game that blends tactical depth with minimalist design, inspired by the likes of <i>ISLANDERS</i> and <i>Luck be a Landlord</i>. Immerse yourself in a vibrant, neon-soaked world where each turn presents new challenges and opportunities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the architect of a growing digital garden, you'll carefully place structures and units to expand your territory, earning resources and unlocking powerful synergies along the way. The balance between risk and reward is key\u2014will you play it safe or gamble on high-stakes upgrades? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211750/extras/a4cced12b0b017f26ffd4e71f7d7b902.poster.avif?t=1770205975\" width=736 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211750/extras/a4cced12b0b017f26ffd4e71f7d7b902.webm?t=1770205975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211750/extras/a4cced12b0b017f26ffd4e71f7d7b902.mp4?t=1770205975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a unique combination of procedural generation and strategic depth, NeonGarten keeps you on your toes. Every game offers a fresh experience, demanding you to adapt, optimize, and evolve your tactics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based Strategy: Plan your moves carefully, with each decision shaping the future of your neon garden.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural Generation: No two runs are the same, offering endless replayability and new challenges every time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist, Cyberpunk Aesthetic: Dive into a stunning retro-futuristic world, where glowing lights meet strategic depth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Islanders and Luck be a Landlord: Combine the simplicity of city-building with the thrill of roguelike progression.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're looking for a laid-back yet engaging strategy experience or a deep, ever-changing puzzle to solve, NeonGarten offers a unique blend of both worlds.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Biggest Loser","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3211750/be2d3db7402930577f80bf8de6bb7c3fa4e15d2c.jpg"},{"name":"Day 65","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3211750/169ee008644cf1939bc9a023757581486ffa7790.jpg"},{"name":"Dystopia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3211750/120ffea3a6db72b14146bb793cd54e93be5857e8.jpg"},{"name":"The Rich Get Richer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3211750/d0176a6b9d2d824515a0df438a5cf3f6916cc50c.jpg"},{"name":"Toxic Paradise","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3211750/c11572e389312b792fc55597e426c9544b193026.jpg"},{"name":"Byte Overflow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3211750/2a73520404ece2951bfc4d15ceb32189589fcbb2.jpg"},{"name":"Plaza of Profit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3211750/507207d52886a209664857833f74d3181ac2bf64.jpg"},{"name":"Millionaire's Row","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3211750/166e47b2b835e8305793265c03abaf509c8acb3f.jpg"},{"name":"Billionaire's Row","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3211750/b0cd5f12f23c73e4151781b89a46f596d3d3ec6c.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3211750?t=1770205975","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211750/c6d425fc4a88914d43b78867a4ea418fe61e9b06/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770205975","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211750/4508f6cc1ae77b9479a18630fe3e57d88d1682c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770205975","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211750/4508f6cc1ae77b9479a18630fe3e57d88d1682c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770205975","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3211880,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211750/extras/b18a84fa0b10129b36b19d5cd031e5db.poster.avif?t=1770205975\" width=650 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211750/extras/b18a84fa0b10129b36b19d5cd031e5db.webm?t=1770205975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211750/extras/b18a84fa0b10129b36b19d5cd031e5db.mp4?t=1770205975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neongarten is a captivating turn-based strategy game that blends tactical depth with minimalist design, inspired by the likes of <i>ISLANDERS</i> and <i>Luck be a Landlord</i>. Immerse yourself in a vibrant, neon-soaked world where each turn presents new challenges and opportunities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the architect of a growing digital garden, you'll carefully place structures and units to expand your territory, earning resources and unlocking powerful synergies along the way. The balance between risk and reward is key\u2014will you play it safe or gamble on high-stakes upgrades? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211750/extras/a4cced12b0b017f26ffd4e71f7d7b902.poster.avif?t=1770205975\" width=736 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211750/extras/a4cced12b0b017f26ffd4e71f7d7b902.webm?t=1770205975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211750/extras/a4cced12b0b017f26ffd4e71f7d7b902.mp4?t=1770205975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a unique combination of procedural generation and strategic depth, NeonGarten keeps you on your toes. Every game offers a fresh experience, demanding you to adapt, optimize, and evolve your tactics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based Strategy: Plan your moves carefully, with each decision shaping the future of your neon garden.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural Generation: No two runs are the same, offering endless replayability and new challenges every time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist, Cyberpunk Aesthetic: Dive into a stunning retro-futuristic world, where glowing lights meet strategic depth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Islanders and Luck be a Landlord: Combine the simplicity of city-building with the thrill of roguelike progression.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're looking for a laid-back yet engaging strategy experience or a deep, ever-changing puzzle to solve, NeonGarten offers a unique blend of both worlds.</p>","developers":["Moonroof Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211750/header.jpg?t=1770205975","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3211750/870647/17a95e8556fa86be52d976b72e3c5ca2e3486d5d/1750881384/dash_av1.mpd?t=1745684259","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3211750/870647/17a95e8556fa86be52d976b72e3c5ca2e3486d5d/1750881384/dash_h264.mpd?t=1745684259","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3211750/870647/17a95e8556fa86be52d976b72e3c5ca2e3486d5d/1750881384/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1745684259","id":257126327,"name":"Release Date Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126327/934dbfe5ea6e173f0853c13ff780966dc2ba819e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745684259"}],"name":"Neongarte